  "narrative": "The domain models the structural analysis and evolution of a codebase by tracking software components and their interconnections. Analyzed code constructs are cataloged as classes that link to other classes through directed structural relationships, while data models model high-level entities and their schema bindings. Repository diff operations aggregate individual file modifications under comparison results to show how the codebase changes over time."
